# =====================================================================
# API manually test karne ki file (VS Code extension: "REST Client")
# Har request ke upar "Send Request" link aata hai — click karo.
# Pehle: npm run dev:api  +  npm run db:seed
# =====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. Health (public — token nahi chahiye)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Login → response me accessToken milega
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@crm.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe@123"
}

### 3. Me — login (request 2) ka token automatically use hota hai
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Staff list (sirf MANAGER / SUPER_ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Bina token → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff

### 6. Galat body → 400 (validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email"
}
